---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Devup Consulting SAS | Miller Arias"
  description="Miller Arias' experience at Devup Consulting SAS: full stack development on an open-source telecommunications platform with Go, React, Relay, and GraphQL."
>
  <!-- Main Container with page transitions -->
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-16 md:mt-24" transition:name="card-status">
    <!-- Back button -->
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-neutral-500 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors group"
    >
      <span class="inline-block transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform">
        ←
      </span>
      Back to the bento
    </a>

    <!-- EXPERIENCE HEADER -->
    <header class="mb-12 mt-11">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
          Current Experience
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
          B2B / Enterprise Telecom
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-100 mb-2">
        Devup Consulting SAS
      </h1>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-neutral-400 font-medium mb-6">
        Full Stack Developer (React & Go)
      </h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Development and optimization of core interfaces and services for a
        network and telecommunications management platform. Focused on
        guaranteeing data integrity, system resilience, and impeccable usability
        for high-level corporate clients (such as VIVO and NTT).
      </p>
    </header>

    <hr class="border-neutral-900 my-12" />

    <!-- IMPACT AND TECHNICAL ACHIEVEMENTS -->
    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Core Initiatives: Fast Track & Usability
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Achievement 1: DB Error Prevention -->
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
              1
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
                Persistence Protection and Truncation Prevention (Error 1406)
              </h3>
              <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
                I identified and resolved validation vulnerabilities where
                massive *payloads* (more than 255 characters in report
                configurations) were rejected directly by the MySQL database
                with the{" "}
                <code class="bg-neutral-950 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs border border-neutral-800">
                  Error 1406 (22001): Data too long
                </code>
                .
              </p>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20">
                <strong>Solution implemented:</strong> Strict validation
                architecture in the Front-End (React) to intercept long strings
                and uncontrolled inputs before API consumption, reducing server
                load and preventing silent crashes.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Achievement 2: Input Sanitization and Business Logic -->
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
              2
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
                Threshold Sanitization and Performance Algorithms
              </h3>
              <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
                In the <em>Performance Management</em> module (KPI Views), the
                system allowed the insertion of logically impossible metrics
                (e.g., a minimum time of 0, or overflowing numeric values such
                as{" "}
                <code class="bg-neutral-950 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs border border-neutral-800">
                  9999999999999999999
                </code>
                ).
              </p>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20">
                <strong>Solution implemented:</strong> Development of UI
                guardrails that block saving invalid thresholds and inject
                immediate visual feedback, ensuring that the metrics sent to the
                Go backend are 100% coherent and operable.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Achievement 3: Client/Server Alignment -->
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
              3
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
                User Experience Alignment (Front/Back Coherence)
              </h3>
              <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                I led the unification of error messages between server
                validations and the user interface. Meeting corporate client
                requirements (alignments with NTT COE and Vivo), I ensured that
                backend failures were translated into friendly, actionable
                alerts, blocking improper configurations that invalidated the
                use of alarm modules.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TECHNOLOGY STACK -->
    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Technical Environment & Tools
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-center">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          React.js
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          Go (Golang)
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          MySQL
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          Chrome DevTools
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          TypeScript
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          REST APIs
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          Git / Version Control
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-neutral-300">
          Agile / Fast Track
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PAGE FOOTER -->
    <footer class="mt-24 pt-8 border-t border-neutral-800 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500">
        Miller Arias • Professional Experience • Devup Consulting SAS
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
